// view — the shared representation embedded in every XDR view type.
// =============================================================================

// view is a typed, read-only window into raw XDR bytes:
//
//	d   open-ended data: starts at this value's first byte and extends to the
//	    enclosing buffer's end (the value's extent is computed lazily)
//	off absolute offset of d[0] from the top-level parse's base
//	w   shared traversal state; nil for detached views
